# ====================================================================
# 🎵 AUDIO ENGINE PIPELINES & TRACK ARCHIVES
# ====================================================================
# 1. Blindly ignore all common audio payloads everywhere in the project
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.m4a

# 2. Explicitly ensure entire raw asset audio folders are wiped from tracking
/assets/music/

# 3. CRITICAL: Whitelist specific localized static audio tracks if needed downstream
# (If you ever want an MP3 to bypass the ban, you MUST negate it explicitly like this):
# !/assets/fallback-sounds/click.mp3